 정보","v":"개인 트레일러 입장가능","items":["개인 트레일러 입장가능"]},{"k":"기타 주변이용가능시설","v":"신두리 해안사구 센터","items":["신두리 해안사구 센터"]},{"k":"기타 부대시설","v":"해안가 해수욕 후 이용 가능한 샤워시설 보유","items":["해안가 해수욕 후 이용 가능한 샤워시설 보유"]},{"k":"사이트 간격","v":"3M"},{"k":"바닥형태 (단위:면)","v":"파쇄석 (36)","items":["파쇄석 (36)"]},{"k":"사이트 크기","v":"8 X 7 : 27개 · 7 X 7 : 4개 · 15 X 7 : 5개"},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"소형견만 가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (36)","items":["소화기 (36)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/3047O5btrvIF3uaaGFrTZauC.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/20672IawcivMson2nZOTzC7s.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/3197vUs4gw50Z3tZAWJXFBXs.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/3954JxqZE71aViUflA8aXcpC.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/7578rshpjZ4WZqfoXrSn6mS7.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/5994CO5d4MJrXYvS35ymKK0l.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/18524N8wZtDdZ1857xuVqMk0.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/0088GjyhmuPqcLxP1Sbs1rnp.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/2594gCOK3QWEsf08rFpKxEh1.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/1169koTf1TH91mCiUKNVakuJ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/2994EXfLh9VElPiymMoufyww.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/2033x3IJgGwMbD5OY6sjQbw6.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/7947IEzqzfbRn72W8LUNH8lm.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/6161sl8eNmtkBqHgZJSVdIx2.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/1554W7uPXnVuUc8pgeyKLgFB.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/243474iIqF70B3WMExnjxMPe.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/91033H7R07jZDf0e0v3LMAzX.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/7251sv0nIDApiYXN3t2KhCWY.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101524/60293FwK6Pxv3ybybtiolGzO.jpg","https://www.gocamping